title: "HPI-CT: Healthcare Program Integrity Control Toolkit"
abstract: "A free, open internal-control framework and toolkit that helps healthcare payers, providers, and program-integrity agencies find and close the control gaps that fraud, waste, and abuse exploit before payment. Aligned to the GAO Green Book (2025) and COSO; grounded in over 1,550 coded U.S. DOJ healthcare-fraud enforcement actions."
